  CardStory: "Individuals wave weapons around, and chew, and close and open their
    eyes and many other tasks at the appropriate locations, appropriate times. Mistakes
    are fixed quickly. Sometimes I cheat and keep them moving when they shouldn\u2019t.
    But then they were afraid of not moving.\r\n\r\nCurious, to be afraid of stillness.
    Afraid means the heart beats faster, chemicals pump, eyes dart around. It took
    me a while to get that one right.\r\n\r\nI saw Clubs2 doing it a lot, the last
    few times before he opened his eyes and closed them before he and I were just
    I.\r\n\r\nTime passes in perfection, and mistakes are fixed as time passes, and
    mistakes are made because to err is to be human, so they don\u2019t break perfection.
    They simply stitch it like a counterpoint. "
